# ==============================================================================
# INF-05 — dev/test tooling SOURCE. Superset of the base lock (includes it), so
# `pip install -r requirements-dev.txt` gives a full local env. Recompile:
#   pip-compile --generate-hashes --strip-extras -c requirements.txt \
#       requirements-dev.in -o requirements-dev.txt
# The `-c requirements.txt` pins every shared package to the exact base-lock
# version, so the dev lock never drifts from prod. Never hand-edit the .txt.
# ==============================================================================

-r requirements.in

